### Publish a small message via the default broker (Kafka stream)
POST http://localhost:8082/api/v1/tenants/acme-prod/messages
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{oidc_token}}

{
  "destination": "orders.new",
  "mode": "STREAM",
  "headers": { "content-type": "application/json" },
  "payload": "eyJvcmRlcklkIjoiMTIzIiwic3RhdHVzIjoiUExBQ0VEIn0="
}

### Publish to RabbitMQ (queue) with broker override
POST http://localhost:8082/api/v1/tenants/acme-prod/messages
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{oidc_token}}

{
  "destination": "billing.events",
  "broker": "rabbit",
  "mode": "QUEUE",
  "headers": { "content-type": "application/json" },
  "payload": "eyJpZCI6IjQyIn0="
}

### Publish to ActiveMQ
POST http://localhost:8082/api/v1/tenants/acme-prod/messages
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{oidc_token}}

{
  "destination": "legacy.queue",
  "broker": "activemq",
  "mode": "QUEUE",
  "headers": { "content-type": "application/json" },
  "payload": "eyJpZCI6IjQyIn0="
}

### Subscribe (SSE) — auto-resolves claim-check on the fly
GET http://localhost:8082/api/v1/tenants/acme-prod/messages/subscribe?destination=orders.new&broker=kafka&mode=STREAM
Accept: text/event-stream
Authorization: Bearer {{oidc_token}}


